// A grotto announces itself like ruins and found places: the first time the mole comes within 8 m of the
// hollow, one line goes in the log ("A grotto, N m down: water seeps through the rock here, root-trees
// drink it, and glowmites drift in the hollow. Cut root-trees for wood."). Once only, and remembered by a save.
// (bedrock roof: a wide room would cave in otherwise)
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#..............................................................................................#
#..............................................................................................#
#..............................................................................................#
#..............................................................................................#
#..............................................................................................#
#...@..........................................................................................#
################################################################################################
end
grotto 1 66 -3 6 3                  // a grotto's hollow (and its glowmites) 16 m to the right
expect 30 log:a_grotto == 0         // too far yet
hold 40-200 right
expect 230 log:a_grotto == 1
expect 230 log:root-trees_drink_it == 1
// away and back: said once
hold 240-330 left
hold 340-480 right
expect 500 log:a_grotto == 1
// a save and load remembers it
saveload 510
hold 520-560 left
hold 570-620 right
expect 660 log:a_grotto == 1
